    description: "Follow-up to WI-javan (PR #3216). WI-javan closed the 4-hour full-suite cadence gap by adding a test-agent-infra job that runs the top-level tests/ directory. However, ci.yml's per-PR smart-test manifest still keys off packages/.*/src/.*\\.py changed-file detection. A PR that changes only .agent/hooks/_shared/*.py or scripts/* produces an empty manifest, so ci.yml's 'Run tests with coverage' step skips pytest entirely and the per-PR gate is silent on agent-infrastructure regressions. Fix: teach scripts/smart-test (and the ci.yml workflow reading the manifest) to recognize a curated _SOURCE_PATHS allowlist including .agent/hooks/_shared/*.py, scripts/agent-supervisor, scripts/agent-notes, scripts/auto-pr, scripts/merge-pr, etc., and map each to the relevant top-level tests/test_*.py file. Acceptance: a PR that only touches .agent/hooks/_shared/awaits_bakeoff_nudge.py runs tests/test_awaits_bakeoff_nudge.py in ci.yml."  # 7042
    fields: {}  # 7042
